'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Crops|Fruit Tree]] seed that takes 28 days to grow into a [[Pear Tree]], after which it will produce one [[Pear]] each day during {{Season|Spring}}. Like all Fruit Trees, it will produce year round if planted in the [[Stardew:Greenhouse|Greenhouse]] or on [[Stardew:Ginger Island|Ginger Island]].

Saplings can be purchased from [[Stardew:Pierre's General Store|Pierre's General Store]], [[JojaMart]], and may randomly appear for sale in at the [[Stardew:Traveling Cart|Traveling Cart]]. They can also be obtained by chopping down existing Pear Trees or by placing [[Pear]] in the [[Stardew:Seed Maker|Seed Maker]].

